    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/9cac781d7a44020606ea52b470d162e8.poster.avif?t=1740089567\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/9cac781d7a44020606ea52b470d162e8.webm?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/9cac781d7a44020606ea52b470d162e8.mp4?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Welcome Home</strong></i> is a psychological horror game that immerses you in the unsettling life of a secluded village preparing for its annual festival. Experience a chilling tale of <i>tradition</i>, <i>trust</i>, and <i>terror</i>, narrated through your journey of uncovering dark secrets and <strong>making choices that determine your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/d5a4350c522e1b9bd4ae13fac582f378.poster.avif?t=1740089567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/d5a4350c522e1b9bd4ae13fac582f378.webm?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/d5a4350c522e1b9bd4ae13fac582f378.mp4?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX Style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth &amp; Survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/c59b3bc8d3c4868590479b2f01f8887a.poster.avif?t=1740089567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/c59b3bc8d3c4868590479b2f01f8887a.webm?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/c59b3bc8d3c4868590479b2f01f8887a.mp4?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is around 30 - 60 minutes long depending on your skills and playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game contains themes of religious rituals, unsettling imagery, blood, violence, and psychological distress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/5a95874a21d849c554b839f314cd9fae.poster.avif?t=1740089567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/5a95874a21d849c554b839f314cd9fae.webm?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434440/extras/5a95874a21d849c554b839f314cd9fae.mp4?t=1740089567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
